  "sweeps": {
    "about": "The no-op control sweep's routes per spec (app/e2e/control-sweep.ts reads them), and the files each route draws, under app/src: scripts/gate-scope.mjs --sweep sweeps a route when a change reaches one of them. A route also draws the app shell, and an /e2e/ route the fixtures in dev-routes.tsx; a change that reaches either sweeps every route, or every /e2e/ route. `pages` are the screens App.tsx imports for its first paint; the screens it loads on demand count on their own.",
    "pages": [
      "screens/HomeScreen.tsx",
      "screens/SignInScreen.tsx"
    ],
